### Patterns Added to `.cursor/rules/common-bugs.mdc`

- Always check `res.ok` before `res.json()`; use `.catch(() => ({}))` for error body extraction
- `try-finally` without `catch` silently swallows errors — always set error state in `catch`
- Never hardcode credentials as config fallbacks
- Never send `Authorization: ""` — throw early if token is unavailable

